Makefile*
# Qt Creator shadow-build dirs (build-GpgFrontend-Desktop_Qt_...). CI workflows
# are named build-*.yml and are not what this pattern is after, and neither is
# the provenance matrix -- `*build-*` matches anything with "build-" ANYWHERE
# in the name, which is a wide net for a rule aimed at directory prefixes.
#
# expected-build-matrix.json was swallowed by it silently: committed to nothing,
# invisible to `git status`, and absent from every checkout, so the provenance
# gate failed in CI on a file that was right there on the machine that wrote it.
*build-*
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!resource/provenance/expected-build-matrix.json
*.qm
*.prl

